WEBVTT

00:09:29.670 --> 00:09:31.730
over how good I turned out, you know? (Laughter)

00:09:31.730 --> 00:09:35.251
And it's my zipper, and I've still got the staples in

00:09:35.251 --> 00:09:36.487
and everything.

00:09:36.487 --> 00:09:38.702
And

00:09:38.702 --> 00:09:41.313
later on, when I got out

00:09:41.313 --> 00:09:46.925
and the flashbacks and the

00:09:46.925 --> 00:09:51.430
nightmares were giving me a hard time,

00:09:51.430 --> 00:09:53.112
I went back to him

00:09:53.112 --> 00:09:57.005
and I was sort of asking him,

00:09:57.005 --> 00:09:59.186
you know, what am I gonna do?

00:09:59.186 --> 00:10:03.794
And I think, kind of, as a surgeon, he basically said,